9,"r5_spy":-0.0352,"r20_spy":-0.1129}}],"quotes":[{"c":"PDD 2018 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2019-03-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Zheng Huang","x":"One of the innovative method is transparent manufacturing, where we build the user trust through production live streaming and a greater supply chain traceability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/13/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2018 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2019-03-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Zheng Huang","x":"These include continued investments in bolstering our technology infrastructure, recommendation algorithms, advertisement platform, and AI capabilities, to name a few.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/13/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2018 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2019-03-13","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tian Xu","x":"Through investing in our distributed AI infrastructure, we see meaningful opportunities to increase our efficiency and scale faster in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/13/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2018 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2019-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Zheng Huang","x":"…sales volume for our 418.5 million paying users, gives these manufacturers the confidence to plan and streamline their manufacturing process, reduce wastage, and optimize their distribution layers to offer more tailored and a better quality product to our users at more attractive prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/13/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2019 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2019-05-20","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"We plan to enhance our distributor AI infrastructure and invest in core technologies, that can help us improve our user experience and product quality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/20/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2019 Q2","e":"pdd","d":"2019-08-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"We are on track with our plan to add at least 2,000 engineers, this year and will continue to invest in our distributed AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2019 Q2","e":"pdd","d":"2019-08-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"…to address different supply chain SaaS opportunities that may arise from working closely with our factories and agriculture producers and to realize further restructuring of the value chain in order to reallocate economic value across the supply chain to the producers and benefit our consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/21/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2019 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2020-03-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"And we decided to introduce live streaming function for our merchants a few months ago on popular request.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/11/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2019 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2020-03-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"And we will observe how things proceed before pushing monetization of live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/11/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2020-05-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Colin Zheng Huang","x":"Let me highlight three specific change; first, live streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/22/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2020-05-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Colin Zheng Huang","x":"We launched our live streaming service in November last year and we have found it to be an effective tool in lowering the barriers to helping consumers overcome their aversion to buying certain product categories online.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/22/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2020-05-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Colin Zheng Huang","x":"In the near-term these initiatives might have been higher bandwidth costs, more cost to help offset the price increases for medical and household essentials or even more free traffic support for our mostly trusted merchants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/22/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2020-05-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Colin Zheng Huang","x":"These include continuing to improve on corporate governance, upgrading internal systems, improving personnel development and evaluation, streamline internal approval process and motivating more internal idea generation and resource competition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/22/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q2","e":"pdd","d":"2020-08-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"We can help build awareness that promote origin stories to marketing, including virtual live streaming tours.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/21/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q2","e":"pdd","d":"2020-08-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"Thomas, in terms of live streaming, we have seen continuing adoption of our merchants using the live streaming as a feature to create engagement with consumers on our platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/21/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q3","e":"pdd","d":"2020-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lei Chen","x":"If you take a look at the mobile payment, live streaming, they are both good examples of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/12/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q3","e":"pdd","d":"2020-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"Further, we are exploring more software services to make it easier for merchants to streamline their operations, such as raw material analysis, inventory prediction, supply chain tracking, partial industrial automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/12/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2021-03-17","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lei Chen","x":"In addition, live streaming and online business on our platform have created new rules that prioritize different skillsets as a lot inclusion of users whom otherwise would be excluded.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/17/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2021-03-17","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"To relieve difficulties brought about by COVID-19, we sponsor live streaming sessions for poverty-stricken farm communities and established dedicated channels to promote their products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/17/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2021-03-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"This new solution goes beyond streamlining distribution, you will be different from existing ones and it will take time, resources and multiple iterations for us to eventually arrive at what works best.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/17/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2020 Q4","e":"pdd","d":"2021-03-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Ma","x":"And a few key drivers we can think of and on the new e-site, let's take, if we are able to streamline unnecessary layers of the distribution and each layer traditionally would take up a meaningful mark up, so a more efficient supply chain would also mean less of spoilage and all of these factors…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/17/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2021 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2021-05-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"This relationship has deepened with initiatives such as help the farmers live streaming session last year when COVID-19 struck.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2021 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2021-05-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Liu","x":"Famous historians and writers join our live streaming sessions to recommend books to readers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2021 Q3","e":"pdd","d":"2021-11-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lei Chen","x":"…geographical indications and agricultural brands through technology innovations such as live-streaming, video marketing, etc. The most awareness consumers have, the more agitated farmers are, the more value can be created to agriculture communities in China. We're also designing tech-enabled","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/26/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2021 Q3","e":"pdd","d":"2021-11-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jing Ma","x":"We launched the total harvest hawk and designed a series of initiatives to help farmers to sell better, including live streaming, merchant training, traffic support, etc. Over 280, 000 agri merchants participated in our event this year, nearly double the number last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/26/pinduoduo-inc-pdd-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2026 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2026-05-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Unknown Executive","x":"These include compliance review of business qualifications, food advertising cost moderation through live streaming monitoring and building a dedicated food database.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/pdd-pdd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2026 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2026-05-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Unknown Executive","x":"We have also enhanced compliance inspection of live streaming, upgraded food safety reporting channels and strengthen automated and menu monitoring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/pdd-pdd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2026 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2026-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lei Chen","x":"…we have listed cagey on our shortcomings and have taken decisive steps to rectify our operations. restructuring our internal management and strengthening our team's compliance awareness, we are building a foundation that manages the long-term health growth of the company and the industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/pdd-pdd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2026 Q1","e":"pdd","d":"2026-05-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Unknown Executive","x":"Regarding your first question, since the beginning of this year, we have been driving a deep restructuring organization and internal management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/pdd-pdd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PDD 2026 Q2","e":"pdd","d":"2026-08-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jiazhen Zhao","x":"At the same time, the platform introduced more detailed requirements governing the per